Three roadmap items and what the commercial team associates with them:
— scenario comparison (two plans side-by-side): cited in 9 open deals, about 210 million ₽ in pipeline. Blocked because two plans double the recalculation cost;
— collaborative planning: 4 deals, about 70 million ₽. Blocked by locking during recalculation;
— automated event-driven replanning: 3 deals, about 50 million ₽. Requires recalculation in seconds.

The annual growth target is 61% complete with three quarters already passed.

Our two largest clients complained about recalculation times in letters; one made it a condition for renewal in two quarters.
